sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant A as API Server
    participant R as Redis
    participant NS as Notification Service
    participant WS as WebSocket Server

    C->>A: POST /action
    A->>R: PUBLISH notifications:user:123 "New notification"
    R->>NS: Message
    NS->>R: XADD user:123:events * type notification data "..."
    NS->>R: PUBLISH user:123:websocket "New notification"
    R->>WS: Message
    WS->>C: Send websocket message